{"id":"wb-8-290","name":"金清大桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"金清大桥","text":"金清大桥，又名寺前桥，位于中华人民共和国浙江省温岭市（台州市代管）的金清港上。该桥始建于清朝乾隆年间，嘉庆年间曾有重修。该桥为五孔拱券石桥，桥的两端建有方亭。2019年，金清大桥被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E6%B8%85%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":92245115,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92245115","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a5873f8d688db30ea3776ef6.jpg","title":"Jinqing_Great_Bridge,_2022-02-14_29.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jinqing_Great_Bridge,_2022-02-14_29.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Jinqing_Great_Bridge%2C_2022-02-14_29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​温岭金清大桥","width":320,"height":214}}